DejaVu fonts 2.37 — License

The DejaVu fonts are based on Bitstream Vera fonts, and are covered under the
following two licenses:

  1) Bitstream Vera Fonts Copyright (c) 2003 by Bitstream, Inc.
     All Rights Reserved.

  2) Arev Fonts Copyright (c) 2006 by Tavmjong Bah.
     All Rights Reserved.

Notes on the DejaVu modifications:

  * The DejaVu modifications are covered under the same two licenses above,
    plus the following additional license:

  3) Modifications for Cyrillic, Greek and other scripts, and to provide
     coverage of WGL4 character set, by Jim Hyslop, et al. — covered by
     the same terms as the original DejaVu fonts.

